Value Filldown interface (\S+)
Value rx_high_alarm_dbm (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value tx_high_alarm_dbm (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rx_low_alarm_dbm (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value tx_low_alarm_dbm (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^${interface}\s+transceiver\s+diagnostic\s+information:\s*$$
  ^\s+High\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+${rx_high_alarm_dbm}\s+${tx_high_alarm_dbm}\s*$$
  ^\s+Low\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+${rx_low_alarm_dbm}\s+${tx_low_alarm_dbm}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
